nning of the 2026–27 school year:&l;/strong&g;&l;/p&g;\n&l;ul&g;\n  &l;li&g;Kindergarten, with a focus on foundational literacy, math, and STEM skills&l;/li&g;\n  &l;li&g;Grades 7 and 8 History with new mandatory learning on the history of Black Canadians&l;/li&g;\n  &l;li&g;Grade 10 History with new mandatory learning about Black history in Canada and new and expanded learning on the Holocaust and Holodomor, as well as the dangers of extreme political ideologies&l;/li&g;\n&l;/ul&g;\n&l;p&g;See the complete list of curriculum below:&l;/p&g;\n&l;object type=\&q;application/kenticocloud\&q; data-type=\&q;item\&q; data-rel=\&q;link\&q; data-codename=\&q;untitled_content_item_54ac922\&q;&g;&l;/object&g;\n&l;object type=\&q;application/kenticocloud\&q; data-type=\&q;item\&q; data-rel=\&q;link\&q; data-codename=\&q;untitled_content_item_5ae48ed\&q;&g;&l;/object&g;\n&l;object type=\&q;application/kenticocloud\&q; data-type=\&q;item\&q; data-rel=\&q;link\&q; data-codename=\&q;untitled_content_item_0d4d067\&q;&g;&l;/object&g;&q;},&q;abstract&q;:{&q;type&q;:&q;text&q;,&q;name&q;:&q;Abstract&q;,&q;value&q;:&q;&q;},&q;credit&q;:{&q;type&q;:&q;rich_text&q;,&q;name&q;:&q;Credit&q;,&q;images&q;:{},&q;links&q;:{},&q;modular_content&q;:[],&q;value&q;:&q;&l;p&g;&l;br&g;&l;/p&g;&q;},&q;parent&q;:{&q;type&q;:&q;modular_content&q;,&q;name&q;:&q;Parent&q;,&q;value&q;:[]},&q;ui_types&q;:{&q;type&q;:&q;taxonomy&q;,&q;name&q;:&q;UI Types&q;,&q;taxonomy_group&q;:&q;ui_types&q;,&q;value&q;:[]},&q;alert_type&q;:{&q;type&q;:&q;multiple_choice&q;,&q;name&q;:&q;Alert type&q;,&q;value&q;:[]},&q;dismissible&q;:{&q;type&q;:&q;multiple_choice&q;,&q;name&q;:&q;Dismissible&q;,&q;value&q;:[]},&q;search_terms&q;:{&q;type&q;:&q;text&q;,&q;name&q;:&q;Search Terms&q;,&q;value&q;:&q;&q;},&q;site___transferable_skills&q;:{&q;type&q;:&q;taxonomy&q;,&q;name&q;:&q;Site - Transferable Skills&q;,&q;taxonomy_group&q;:&q;site___transferable_skills&q;,&q;value&q;:[]},&q;container_type&q;:{&q;type&q;:&q;multiple_choic