ls will teach the newest learning starting in the 2026–2027 school year.&q;},&q;image_for_desktop&q;:{&q;type&q;:&q;asset&q;,&q;name&q;:&q;Image for desktop&q;,&q;value&q;:[{&q;name&q;:&q;SSHG-ENG.svg&q;,&q;description&q;:null,&q;type&q;:&q;image/svg+xml&q;,&q;size&q;:346255,&q;url&q;:&q;https://assets-us-01.kc-usercontent.com:443/fbd574c4-da36-0066-a0c5-849ffb2de96e/871f7a77-6751-4d87-9321-2f36038d82f6/SSHG-ENG.svg&q;}]},&q;image_for_tablet&q;:{&q;type&q;:&q;asset&q;,&q;name&q;:&q;Image for tablet&q;,&q;value&q;:[]},&q;image_for_mobile&q;:{&q;type&q;:&q;asset&q;,&q;name&q;:&q;Image for mobile&q;,&q;value&q;:[]},&q;video_for_desktop&q;:{&q;type&q;:&q;asset&q;,&q;name&q;:&q;Video for desktop&q;,&q;value&q;:[]},&q;image_description&q;:{&q;type&q;:&q;text&q;,&q;name&q;:&q;Image description&q;,&q;value&q;:&q;&q;},&q;button_caption&q;:{&q;type&q;:&q;text&q;,&q;name&q;:&q;Primary button caption&q;,&q;value&q;:&q;&q;},&q;button_type&q;:{&q;type&q;:&q;multiple_choice&q;,&q;name&q;:&q;Primary button type&q;,&q;value&q;:[]},&q;content_link&q;:{&q;type&q;:&q;modular_content&q;,&q;name&q;:&q;Primary content link&q;,&q;value&q;:[]},&q;external_link_url&q;:{&q;type&q;:&q;text&q;,&q;name&q;:&q;Primary external link URL&q;,&q;value&q;:&q;&q;},&q;container_type&q;:{&q;type&q;:&q;multiple_choice&q;,&q;name&q;:&q;Container type&q;,&q;value&q;:[]},&q;secondary_button_caption&q;:{&q;type&q;:&q;text&q;,&q;name&q;:&q;Secondary button caption&q;,&q;value&q;:&q;&q;},&q;secondary_button_type&q;:{&q;type&q;:&q;multiple_choice&q;,&q;name&q;:&q;Secondary button type&q;,&q;value&q;:[]},&q;secondary_content_link&q;:{&q;type&q;:&q;modular_content&q;,&q;name&q;:&q;Secondary content link&q;,&q;value&q;:[]},&q;secondary_external_link_url&q;:{&q;type&q;:&q;text&q;,&q;name&q;:&q;Secondary external link URL&q;,&q;value&q;:&q;&q;}}},&q;lang___fra___summary_knowledge_and_skills&q;:{&q;system&q;:{&q;id&q;:&q;ceb98106-01bf-4b5e-93f9-c89898018111&q;,&q;name&q;:&q;Lang - FRA - Parent Guide - Summary&q;,&q;codename&q;:&q;lang___fra___summary_knowledge_and_skills&q;,&q;language&q;:&q;en-CA&q;,&q;type&q;:&q;ui___content_collection&q;,&q;collection&q;:&q;default&q;,&q;sitemap_locations&q;:[],&q;last_modified&q;:&q;2023-06-15T20:23:26.7812787Z&q;,&q;workflow&q;:&q;default&q;,&q;workflow_step&q;:&q;published&q;},&q;elements&q;:{&q;site___persona&q;:{&q;type&q;:&q;taxonomy&q;,&q;name&q;:&q;Site - Persona&q;,&q;taxonomy_group&q;:&q;site___persona&q;,&q;value&q;:[]},&q;image&q;:{&q;type&q;:&q;asset&q;,&q;name&q;:&q;Image&q;,&q;value&q;:[]},&q;title&q;:{&q;type&q;:&q;text&q;,&q;name&q;:&q;Title&q;,&q;value&q;:&q;Summary of major knowledge and skills&q;},&q;url_slug&q;:{&q;type&q;:&q;url_slug&q;,&q;name&q;:&q;Url Slug&q;,&q;value&q;:&q;summary&q;},&q;content&q;:{&q;type&q;:&q;rich_text&q;,&q;name&q;:&q;Content&q;,&q;images&q;:{},&q;links&q;:{},&q;modular_content&q;:[],&q;value&q;:&q;&l;p&g;The curriculum will teach students foundational language and literacy concepts, knowledge and skills to prepare them for success now and in the future. Learning to communicate clearly with confidence using both traditional and digital media will help students thrive.&l;/p&g;\n&l;p&g;Language development is central to a student’s intellectual, social and emotional growth, which is a key element of the curriculum. Throughout the grades and areas of learning, students learn to apply their understanding with increasing sophistication.&l;/p&g;\n&l;p&g;The relationship between a student’s understanding of spoken language and their reading skills is integral to motivating them to read with understanding, joy and emotion. This enables students to read and write with confidence.&l;/p&g;\n&l;p&g;The revised curriculum describes the knowledge and skills that students are expected to learn. It is organized in four distinct but interrelated areas, with language and literacy skills being taught and assessed throughout all areas of learning.&l;/p&g;&q;},&q;note&q;:{&q;type&q;:&q;text&q;,&q;name&q;:&q;Note&q;,&q;value&q;:&q;&q;},&q;sections&q;:{&q;type&q;:&q;modular_content&q;,&q;name&q;:&q;Sections&q;,&q;value&q;:[&q;lang___fra___summary___strand_a&q;,&q;lang___fra___summary___strand_a__copy_&q;,&q;lang___fra___summary___strand_b__copy_&q;,&q;lang___fra___summary___strand_c__copy_&q;]},&q;ui_types&q;:{&q;type&q;:&q;taxonomy&q;,&q;name&q;:&q;UI Types&q;,&q;taxonomy_group&q;:&q;ui_types&q;,&q;value&q;:[]},&q;abstract&q;:{&q;type&q;:&q;text&q;,&q;name&q;:&q;Abstract&q;,&q;value&q;:&q;&q;},&q;search_terms&q;:{&q;type&q;:&q;text&q;,&q;name&q;:&q;Search Terms&q;,&q;value&q;:&q;&q;},&q;ui___seo_meta_tags__description&q;:{&q;type&q;:&q;text&q;,&q;name&q;:&q;description&q;,&q;value&q;:&q;&q;},&q;ui___seo_meta_tags__keywords&q;:{&q;type&q;:&q;text&q;,&q;name&q;:&q;keywords&q;,&q;value&q;:&q;&q;},&q;ui___seo_meta_tags__robots&q;:{&q;type&q;:&q;text&q;,&q;name&q;:&q;robots&q;,&q;value&q;:&q;&q;},&q;ui___seo_meta_tags__og_title&q;:{&q;type&q;:&q;text&q;,&q;name&q;:&q;og:title&q;,&q;value&q;:&q;&q;},&q;ui___seo_meta_tags__og_description&q;:{&q;type&q;:&q;text&q;,&q;name&q;:&q;og:description&q;,&q;value&q;:&q;&q;}}},&q;lang___fra___summary_knowledge_and_skills__copy_&q;:{&q;system&q;:{&q;id&q;:&q;9df55161-2646-4044-901f-886b3413ffc3&q;,&q;name&q;:&q;Lang - FRA - Parent Guide - By grade&q;,&q;codename&q;:&q;lang___fra___summary_knowledge_and_skills__copy_&q;,&q;language&q;:&q;en-CA&q;,&q;type&q;:&q;ui___content_collection&q;,&q;collection&q;:&q;default&q;,&q;sitemap_locations&q;:[],&q;last_modified&q;:&q;2023-06-15T20:22:52.9468296Z&q;,&q;workflow&q;:&q;default&q;,&q;workflow_step&q;:&q;published&q;},&q;elements&q;:{&q;site___persona&q;:{&q;type&q;:&q;taxonomy&q;,&q;name&q;:&q;Site - Persona&q;,&q;taxonomy_group&q;:&q;site___persona&q;,&q;value&q;:[]},&q;image&q;:{&q;type&q;:&q;asset&q;,&q;name&q;:&q;Image&q;,&q;value&q;:[]},&q;title&q;:{&q;type&q;:&q;text&q;,&q;name&q;:&q;Title&q;,&q;value&q;:&q;Find out what students learn by grade&q;},&q;url_slug&q;:{&q;type&q;:&q;url_slug&q;,&q;name&q;:&q;Url Slug&q;,&q;value&q;:&q;by-grade&q;},&q;content&q;:{&q;type&q;:&q;rich_text&q;,&q;name&q;:&q;Content&q;,&q;images&q;:{},&q;links&q;:{},&q;modular_content&q;:[],&q;value&q;:&q;&l;p&g;Acquiring the knowledge and skills described in the language curriculum enables students to understand, respond to, appreciate and create texts in various forms, genres and media, including digital and media texts.&l;/p&g;&q;},&q;note&q;:{&q;type&q;:&q;text&q;,&q;name&q;:&q;Note&q;,&q;value&q;:&q;&q;},&q;sections&q;:{&q;type&q;:&q;modular_content&q;,&q;name&q;:&q;Sections&q;,&q;value&q;:[&q;lang___fra___summary___strand_a__copy__af3c09a&q;,&q;lang___fra___learning_division___primary__copy_&q;,&q;lang___fra___learning_division___junior__copy_&q;,&q;untitled_content_item_583ac68&q;,&q;lang___fra___learning_grade_5&q;,&q;lang___fra___learning_grade_6&q;,&q;lang___fra___learning_grade_7&q;,&q;lang___fra___learning_grade_8&q;]},&q;ui_types&q;:{&q;type&q;:&q;taxonomy&q;,&q;name&q;:&q;UI Types&q;,&q;taxonomy_group&q;:&q;ui_types&q;,&q;value&q;:[]},&q;abstract&q;:{&q;type&q;:&q;text&q;,&q;name&q;:&q;Abstract&q;,&q;value&q;:&q;&q;},&q;search_terms&q;:{&q;type&q;:&q;text&q;,&q;name&q;:&q;Search Terms&q;,&q;value&q;:&q;&q;},&q;ui___seo_meta_tags__description&q;:{&q;type&q;:&q;text&q;,&q;name&q;:&q;description&q;,&q;value&q;:&q;&q;},&q;ui___seo_meta_tags__keywords&q;:{&q;type&q;:&q;text&q;,&q;name&q;:&q;keywords&q;,&q;value&q;:&q;&q;},&q;ui___seo_meta_tags__robots&q;:{&q;type&q;:&q;text&q;,&q;name&q;:&q;robots&q;,&q;value&q;:&q;&q;},&q;ui___seo_meta_tags__og_title&q;:{&q;type&q;:&q;text&q;,&q;name&q;:&q;og:title&q;,&q;value&q;:&q;&q;},&q;ui___seo_meta_tags__og_description&q;:{&q;type&q;:&q;text&q;,&q;name&q;:&q;og:description&q;,&q;value&q;:&q;&q;}}},&q;lang__fra___growing_success_addendum__copy_&q;:{&q;system&q;:{&q;id&q;:&q;360c6c9c-147c-40d1-b489-6d9181afdcc2&q;,&q;name&q;:&q;Lang- FRA - Link to K-4 Continuum&q;,&q;codename&q;:&q;lang__fra___growing_success_addendum__copy_&q;,&q;languag