n  &l;li&g;As of September 2022, the Grade 9 French as a Second Language courses will be offered using the current Academic courses and course codes (FSF1D, FEF1D and FIF1D).&a;nbsp;&l;/li&g;\n  &l;li&g;Educators should be aware that, with the exception of these courses, the 2014 French as a Second Language curriculum policy for Grades&a;nbsp;9 to 12 will remain in effect.&a;nbsp;&l;/li&g;\n&l;/ul&g;&q;},&q;note&q;:{&q;type&q;:&q;text&q;,&q;name&q;:&q;Note&q;,&q;value&q;:&q;&q;},&q;sections&q;:{&q;type&q;:&q;modular_content&q;,&q;name&q;:&q;Sections&q;,&q;value&q;:[&q;res___course_description_and_prerequisite___esl___&q;,&q;res___course_description_and_prerequisite___esl____faa365d&q;,&q;res___course_description_and_prerequisite___esl____f15621e&q;]},&q;ui_types&q;:{&q;type&q;:&q;taxonomy&q;,&q;name&q;:&q;UI Types&q;,&q;taxonomy_group&q;:&q;ui_types&q;,&q;value&q;:[]},&q;abstract&q;:{&q;type&q;:&q;text&q;,&q;name&q;:&q;Abstract&q;,&q;value&q;:&q;&q;},&q;search_terms&q;:{&q;type&q;:&q;text&q;,&q;name&q;:&q;Search Terms&q;,&q;value&q;:&q;&q;},&q;ui___seo_meta_tags__description&q;:{&q;type&q;:&q;text&q;,&q;name&q;:&q;description&q;,&q;value&q;:&q;&q;},&q;ui___seo_meta_tags__keywords&q;:{&q;type&q;:&q;text&q;,&q;name&q;:&q;keywords&q;,&q;value&q;:&q;&q;},&q;ui___seo_meta_tags__robots&q;:{&q;type&q;:&q;text&q;,&q;name&q;:&q;robots&q;,&q;value&q;:&q;&q;},&q;ui___seo_meta_tags__og_title&q;:{&q;type&q;:&q;text&q;,&q;name&q;:&q;og:title&q;,&q;value&q;:&q;&q;},&q;ui___seo_meta_tags__og_description&q;:{&q;type&q;:&q;text&q;,&q;name&q;:&q;og:description&q;,&q;value&q;:&q;&q;}}},&q;res___course_description_prerequisite___hpe__copy_&q;:{&q;system&q;:{&q;id&q;:&q;60e99777-6b77-403c-9d42-6672ea1ac868&q;,&q;name&q;:&q;RES - Course description Prerequisite - Science&q;,&q;codename&q;:&q;res___course_description_prerequisite___hpe__copy_&q;,&q;language&q;:&q;en-CA&q;,&q;type&q;:&q;ui___content_collection&q;,&q;collection&q;:&q;resources&q;,&q;sitemap_locations&q;:[],&q;last_modified&q;:&q;2022-08-24T11:25:19.6857228Z&q;,&q;workflow&q;:&q;default&q;,&q;workflow_step&q;:&q;published&q;},&q;elements&q;:{&q;site___persona&q;:{&q;type&q;:&q;taxonomy&q;,&q;name&q;:&q;Site - Persona&q;,&q;taxonomy_group&q;:&q;site___persona&q;,&q;value&q;:[]},&q;image&q;:{&q;type&q;:&q;asset&q;,&q;name&q;:&q;Image&q;,&q;value&q;:[{&q;name&q;:&q;Curriculum-science.svg&q;,&q;description&q;:null,&q;type&q;:&q;image/svg+xml&q;,&q;size&q;:1196,&q;url&q;:&q;https://assets-us-01.kc-usercontent.com:443/fbd574c4-da36-0066-a0c5-849ffb2de96e/21be6293-05db-4004-93c1-3ccdd113debc/Curriculum-science.svg&q;}]},&q;title&q;:{&q;type&q;:&q;text&q;,&q;name&q;:&q;Title&q;,&q;value&q;:&q;Science&q;},&q;url_slug&q;:{&q;type&q;:&q;url_slug&q;,&q;name&q;:&q;Url Slug&q;,&q;value&q;:&q;science&q;},&q;content&q;:{&q;type&q;:&q;rich_text&q;,&q;name&q;:&q;Content&q;,&q;images&q;:{},&q;links&q;:{},&q;modular_content&q;:[],&q;value&q;:&q;&l;ul&g;\n  &l;li&g;Educators should be aware that, with the exception of&a;nbsp;the Grade 9 science course, 2022 (SNC1W), the 2008 Science curriculum for Grade 10 and the 2008 Science curriculum for Grades 11–12 remain in effect. All secondary science courses for Grades 10–12 will continue to be based on those documents. All references to Grade 9 that appear in&a;nbsp;&l;em&g;The Ontario Curriculum, Grades 9 and 10: Science, 2008&a;nbsp;&l;/em&g;and&a;nbsp;&l;em&g;The Ontario Curriculum, Grades 11 and 12: Science, 2008&l;/em&g;&a;nbsp;have been superseded by&a;nbsp;&l;a href=\&q;/en/curriculum/secondary-science/courses/snc1w\&q; data-new-window=\&q;true\&q; target=\&q;_blank\&q; rel=\&q;noopener noreferrer\&q;&g;&l;em&g;The Ontario Curriculum, Grade 9: Science, 2022.&l;/em&g;&l;/a&g;&l;/li&g;\n  &l;li&g;As of September 2022, this course replaces Science, Grade 9, Academic (SNC1D) and Science, Grade 9, Applied (SNC1P).&l;/li&g;\n&l;/ul&g;&q;},&q;note&q;:{&q;type&q;:&q;text&q;,&q;name&q;:&q;Note&q;,&q;value&q;:&q;&q;},&q;sections&q;:{&q;type&q;:&q;modular_content&q;,&q;name&q;:&q;Sections&q;,&q;value&q;:[&q;res___course_description_and_prerequisite___hpe___&q;,&q;res___course_description_and_prerequisite___hpe____302a6dd&q;,&q;res___course_description_and_prerequisite___hpe____840200c&q;]},&q;ui_types&q;:{&q;type&q;:&q;taxonomy&q;,&q;name&q;:&q;UI Types&q;,&q;taxonomy_group&q;:&q;ui_types&q;,&q;value&q;:[]},&q;abstract&q;:{&q;type&q;:&q;text&q;,&q;name&q;:&q;Abstract&q;,&q;value&q;:&q;&q;},&q;search_terms&q;:{&q;type&q;:&q;text&q;,&q;name&q;:&q;Search Terms&q;,&q;value&q;:&q;&q;},&q;ui___seo_meta_tags__description&q;:{&q;type&q;:&q;text&q;,&q;name&q;:&q;description&q;,&q;value&q;:&q;&q;},&q;ui___seo_meta_tags__keywords&q;:{&q;type&q;:&q;text&q;,&q;name&q;:&q;keywords&q;,&q;value&q;:&q;&q;},&q;ui___seo_meta_tags__robots&q;:{&q;type&q;:&q;text&q;,&q;name&q;:&q;robots&q;,&q;value&q;:&q;&q;},&q;ui___seo_meta_tags__og_title&q;:{&q;type&q;:&q;text&q;,&q;name&q;:&q;og:title&q;,&q;value&q;:&q;&q;},&q;ui___seo_meta_tags__og_description&q;:{&q;type&q;:&q;text&q;,&q;name&q;:&q;og:description&q;,&q;value&q;:&q;&q;}}},&q;res___course_description_prerequisite___hpe__copy__6e6fa85&q;:{&q;system&q;:{&q;id&q;:&q;6e6fa856-c0ec-4c41-b5f3-6a1b1ac3c531&q;,&q;name&q;:&q;RES - Course description Prerequisite - Interdisciplinary Studies&q;,&q;codename&q;:&q;res___course_description_prerequisite___hpe__copy__6e6fa85&q;,&q;language&q;:&q;en-CA&q;,&q;type&q;:&q;ui___content_collection&q;,&q;collection&q;:&q;resources&q;,&q;sitemap_locations&q;:[],&q;last_modified&q;:&q;2022-04-04T15:40:12.1990127Z&q;,&q;workflow&q;:&q;default&q;,&q;workflow_step&q;:&q;published&q;},&q;elements&q;:{&q;site___persona&q;:{&q;type&q;:&q;taxonomy&q;,&q;name&q;:&q;Site - Persona&q;,&q;taxonomy_group&q;:&q;site___persona&q;,&q;value&q;:[]},&q;image&q;:{&q;type&q;:&q;asset&q;,&q;name&q;:&q;Image&q;,&q;value&q;:[{&q;name&q;:&q;Curriculum_icon_100px_Interdisciplinary -Studies.svg&q;,&q;description&q;:null,&q;type&q;:&q;image/svg+xml&q;,&q;size&q;:1173,&q;url&q;:&q;https://assets-us-01.kc-usercontent.com:443/fbd574c4-da36-0066-a0c5-849ffb2de96e/6edfdefa-77e1-4436-8fc1-379c9685b730/Curriculum_icon_100px_Interdisciplinary%20-Studies.svg&q;}]},&q;title&q;:{&q;type&q;:&q;text&q;,&q;name&q;:&q;Title&q;,&q;value&q;:&q;Interdisciplinary Studies&q;},&q;url_slug&q;:{&q;type&q;:&q;url_slug&q;,&q;name&q;:&q;Url Slug&q;,&q;value&q;:&q;interdisciplinary-studies&q;},&q;content&q;:{&q;type&q;:&q;rich_text&q;,&q;name&q;:&q;Content&q;,&q;images&q;:{},&q;links&q;:{},&q;modular_content&q;:[],&q;value&q;:&q;&l;ul&g;\n  &l;li&g;This curriculum was issued in 2002.&l;/li&g;\n&l;/ul&g;&q;},&q;note&q;:{&q;type&q;:&q;text&q;,&q;name&q;:&q;Note&q;,&q;value&q;:&q;&q;},&q;sections&q;:{&q;type&q;:&q;modular_content&q;,&q;name&q;:&q;Sections&q;,&q;value&q;:[&q;res___course_description_and_prerequisite___hpe____c6e4f7d&q;,&q;res___course_description_and_prerequisite___hpe____5e2cea6&q;]},&q;ui_types&q;:{&q;type&q;:&q;taxonomy&q;,&q;name&q;:&q;UI Types&q;,&q;taxonomy_group&q;:&q;ui_types&q;,&q;value&q;:[]},&q;abstract&q;:{&q;type&q;:&q;text&q;,&q;name&q;:&q;Abstract&q;,&q;value&q;:&q;&q;},&q;search_terms&q;:{&q;type&q;:&q;text&q;,&q;name&q;:&q;Search Terms&q;,&q;value&q;:&q;&q;},&q;ui___seo_meta_tags__description&q;:{&q;type&q;:&q;text&q;,&q;name&q;:&q;description&q;,&q;value&q;:&q;&q;},&q;ui___seo_meta_tags__keywords&q;:{&q;type&q;:&q;text&q;,&q;name&q;:&q;keywords&q;,&q;value&q;:&q;&q;},&q;ui___seo_meta_tags__robots&q;:{&q;type&q;:&q;text&q;,&q;name&q;:&q;robots&q;,&q;value&q;:&q;&q;},&q;ui___seo_meta_tags__og_title&q;:{&q;type&q;:&q;text&q;,&q;name&q;:&q;og:title&q;,&q;value&q;:&q;&q;},&q;ui___seo_meta_tags__og_description&q;:{&q;type&q;:&q;text&q;,&q;name&q;:&q;og:description&q;,&q;value&q;:&q;&q;}}},&q;res___course_description_prerequisite___interdisci&q;:{&q;system&q;:{&q;id&q;:&q;56c9045b-249c-4bb4-816b-b94f4f4f1bd7&q;,&q;name&q;:&q;RES - Course description Prerequisite - Math&q;,&q;codename&q;:&q;res___course_description_prerequisite___interdisci&q;,&q;language&q;:&q;en-CA&q;,&q;type&q;:&q;ui___content_collection&q;,&q;collection&q;:&q;resources&q;,&q;sitemap_locations&q;:[],&q;last_modified&q;:&q;2022-05-04T12:46:25.2095217Z&q;,&q;workflow&q;:&q;default&q;,&q;workflow_step&q;:&q;published&q;},&q;elements&q;:{&q;site___persona&q;:{&q;type&q;:&q;taxonomy&q;,&q;name&q;:&q;Site - Persona&q;,&q;taxonomy_group&q;:&q;site___persona&q;,&q;value&q;:[]},&q;image&q;:{&q;type&q;:&q;asset&q;,&q;name&q;:&q;Image&q;,&q;value&q;:[{&q;name&q;:&q;curriculum-math (1).svg&q;,&q;description&q;:&q;Image for decorative purpose only.&q;,&q;type&q;:&q;image/svg+xml&q;,&q;size&q;:4833,&q;url&q;:&q;https://assets-us-01.kc-usercontent.com:443/fbd574c4-da36-0066-a0c5-849ffb2de96e/ed7a0dc5-d1cf-401e-9650-7d060f7a86f9/curriculum-math%20%281%29.svg&q;}]},&q;title&q;:{&q;type&q;:&q;text&q;,&q;name&q;:&q;Title&q;,&q;value&q;:&q;Mathematics&q;},&q;url_slug&q;:{&q;type&q;:&q;url_slug&q;,&q;name&q;:&q;Url Slug&q;,&q;value&q;:&q;mathematics&q;},&q;content&q;:{&q;type&q;:&q;rich_text&q;,&q;name&q;:&q;Content&q;,&q;images&q;:{},&q;links&q;:{},&q;modular_content&q;:[],&q;value&q;:&q;&l;ul&g;\n  &l;li&g;The Grade 9 Mathematics course (MTH1W) was revised in 2021. This course supersedes the two Grade 9 courses outlined in&a;nbsp;&l;em&g;The Ontario Curriculum, Grades 9 and 10: Mathematics, 2005&l;/em&g;, as well as&a;nbsp;&l;em&g;The Ontario Curriculum: Mathematics&a;nbsp;– Mathematics Transfer Course, Grade&a;nbsp;9, Applied to Academic, 2006&l;/em&g;. Effective September 2021, all mathematics programs for Grade&a;nbsp;9 will be based on the expectations outlined in the &l;a href=\&q;https://www.dcp.edu.gov.on.ca/en/curriculum/secondary-mathematics/courses/mth1w\&q; data-new-window=\&q;true\&q; target=\&q;_blank\&q; rel=\&q;noopener noreferrer\&q;&g;course curriculum.&l;/a&g;&l;/li&g;\n  &l;li&g;The 2005 Mathematics curriculum for Grade 10 and the 2007 Mathematics curriculum for Grades 11–12 remain in effect. All secondary mathematics courses for Grades 10–12 will continue to be based on those documents.&l;/li&g;\n  &l;li&g;All references to Grade 9 that appear in&a;nbsp;&l;em&g;The Ontario Curriculum, Grades 9 and 10: Mathematics, 2005&l;/em&g;&a;nbsp;and&a;nbsp;&l;em&g;The Ontario Curriculum, Grades 11 and 12: Mathematics, 2007&l;/em&g;&a;nbsp;have been superseded by&a;nbsp;&l;em&g;The Ontario Curriculum, Grade 9: Mathematics, 2021&l;/em&g;.&l;/li&g;\n  &l;li&g;&l;a href=\&q;https://www.dcp.edu.gov.on.ca/en/addenda-g10-math\&q;&g;Addenda&l;/a&g; have been issued to the Grade 10 MPM2D and MFM2P courses, to be implemented for the 2022–23 school year.&l;/li&g;\n&l;/ul&g;&q;},&q;note&q;:{&q;type&q;:&q;text&q;,&q;name&q;:&q;Note&q;,&q;value&q;:&q;&q;},&q;sections&q;:{&q;type&q;:&q;modular_content&q;,&q;name&q;:&q;Sections&q;,&q;value&q;:[&q;res___course_description_and_prerequisite___interd&q;,&q;res___course_description_and_prerequisite___hpe____c0bca51&q;,&q;res___course_description_and_prerequisite___hpe____2ec545e&q;]},&q;ui_types&q;:{&q;type&q;:&q;taxonomy&q;,&q;name&q;:&q;UI Types&q;,&q;taxonomy_group&q;:&q;ui_types&q;,&q;value&q;:[]},&q;abstract&q;:{&q;type&q;:&q;text&q;,&q;name&q;:&q;Abstract&q;,&q;value&q;:&q;&q;},&q;search_terms&q;:{&q;type&q;:&q;text&q;,&q;name&q;:&q;Search Terms&q;,&q;value&q;:&q;&q;},&q;ui___seo_meta_tags__description&q;:{&q;type&q;:&q;text&q;,&q;name&q;:&q;description&q;,&q;value&q;:&q;&q;},&q;ui___seo_meta_tags__keywords&q;:{&q;type&q;:&q;text&q;,&q;name&q;:&q;keywords&q;,&q;value&q;:&q;&q;},&q;ui___seo_meta_tags__robots&q;:{&q;type&q;:&q;text&q;,&q;name&q;:&q;robots&q;,&q;value&q;:&q;&q;},&q;ui___seo_meta_tags__og_title&q;:{&q;type&q;:&q;text&q;,&q;name&q;:&q;og:title&q;,&q;value&q;:&q;&q;},&q;ui___seo_meta_tags__og_description&q;:{&q;type&q;:&q;text&q;,&q;name&q;:&q;og:description&q;,&q;value&q;:&q;&q;}}},&q;res___course_description_prerequisite___math__copy&q;:{&q;system&q;:{&q;id&q;:&q;313995b6-3057-4be9-b8a4-7a722b56f804&q;,&q;name&q;:&q;RES - Course description Prerequisite - Native Languages&q;,&q;codename&q;:&q;res___course_description_prerequisite___math__copy&q;,&q;language&q;:&q;en-CA&q;,&q;type&q;:&q;ui___content_collection&q;,&q;collection&q;:&q;resources&q;,&q;sitemap_locations&q;:[],&q;last_modified&q;:&q;2024-06-10T17:29:08.9374984Z&q;,&q;workflow&q;:&q;default&q;,&q;workflow_step&q;:&q;published&q;},&q;elements&q;:{&q;site___persona&q;:{&q;type&q;:&q;taxonomy&q;,&q;name&q;:&q;Site - Persona&q;,&q;taxonomy_group&q;:&q;site___persona&q;,&q;value&q;:[]},&q;image&q;:{&q;type&q;:&q;asset&q;,&q;name&q;:&q;Image&q;,&q;value&q;:[{&q;name&q;:&q;Curriculum-Native-Languages (1).svg&q;,&q;description&q;:null,&q;type&q;:&q;image/svg+xml&q;,&q;size&q;:5517,&q;url&q;:&q;https://assets-us-01.kc-usercontent.com:443/fbd574c4-da36-0066-a0c5-849ffb2de96e/315ad877-ea10-4302-a478-bdd9748a7db2/Curriculum-Native-Languages%20%281%29.svg&q;}]},&q;title&q;:{&q;type&q;:&q;text&q;,&q;name&q;:&q;Title&q;,&q;value&q;:&q;Native Languages&q;},&q;url_slug&q;:{&q;type&q;:&q;url_slug&q;,&q;name&q;:&q;Url Slug&q;,&q;value&q;:&q;native-languages&q;},&q;content&q;:{&q;type&q;:&q;rich_text&q;,&q;name&q;:&q;Content&q;,&q;images&q;:{},&q;links&q;:{},&q;modular_content&q;:[],&q;value&q;:&q;&l;ul&g;\n  &l;li&g;The Grade 9 and 10 curriculum was issued in 1999.&l;/li&g;\n  &l;li&g;The Grade 11 and 12 curriculum was issued in 2000.&l;/li&g;\n  &l;li&g;Since 2021–22, boards are able to offer Inuktitut as a language of instruction within Ontario’s Indigenous languages curricula (Grades 1–12). Five new secondary course codes (LNIAO, LNIBO, LNICO, LNIDO, and LNIEO) have been added in OnSIS.&l;/li&g;\n  &l;li&g;Beginning in the 2024–25 school year, boards are able to offer Algonquin as a language of instruction within Ontario’s Indigenous languages curricula (Grades 1–12). Five new secondary course codes (LNGAO, LNGBO, LNGCO, LNGDO, and LNGEO) have been added in OnSIS.&l;/li&g;\n&l;/ul&g;&q;},&q;note&q;:{&q;type&q;:&q;text&q;,&q;name&q;:&q;Note&q;,&q;value&q;:&q;&q;},&q;sections&q;:{&q;type&q;:&q;modular_content&q;,&q;name&q;:&q;Sections&q;,&q;value&q;:[&q;res___course_description_and_prerequisite___math__&q;,&q;res___course_description_and_prerequisite___math___54766d3&q;,&q;res___course_description_and_prerequisite___math___b3a6897&q;,&q;res___course_description_and_prerequisite___native&q;]},&q;ui_types&q;:{&q;type&q;:&q;taxonomy&q;,&q;name&q;:&q;UI Types&q;,&q;taxonomy_group&q;:&q;ui_types&q;,&q;value&q;:[]},&q;abstract&q;:{&q;type&q;:&q;text&q;,&q;name&q;:&q;Abstract&q;,&q;value&q;:&q;&q;},&q;search_terms&q;:{&q;type&q;:&q;text&q;,&q;name&q;:&q;Search Terms&q;,&q;value&q;:&q;&q;},&q;ui___seo_meta_tags__description&q;:{&q;type&q;:&q;text&q;,&q;name&q;:&q;description&q;,&q;value&q;:&q;&q;},&q;ui___seo_meta_tags__keywords&q;:{&q;type&q;:&q;text&q;,&q;name&q;:&q;keywords&q;,&q;value&q;:&q;&q;},&q;ui___seo_meta_tags__robots&q;:{&q;type&q;:&q;text&q;,&q;name&q;:&q;robots&q;,&q;value&q;:&q;&q;},&q;ui___seo_meta_tags__og_title&q;:{&q;type&q;:&q;text&q;,&q;name&q;:&q;og:title&q;,&q;value&q;:&q;&q;},&q;ui___seo_meta_tags__og_description&q;:{&q;type&q;:&q;text&q;,&q;name&q;:&q;og:description&q;,&q;value&q;:&q;&q;}}},&q;res___course_description_prerequisite___science__c&q;:{&q;system&q;:{&q;id&q;:&q;d9bf0f9b-968c-4b82-b412-3bf092148d56&q;,&q;name&q;:&q;RES - Course description Prerequisite - Social Science Human&q;,&q;codename&q;:&q;res___course_description_prerequisite___science__c&q;,&q;language&q;:&q;en-CA&q;,&q;type&q;:&q;ui___content_collection&q;,&q;collection&q;:&q;resources&q;,&q;sitemap_locations&q;:[],&q;last_modified&q;:&q;2022-04-11T18:07:41.1757285Z&q;,&q;workflow&q;:&q;default&q;,&q;workflow_step&q;:&q;published&q;},&q;elements&q;:{&q;site___persona&q;:{&q;type&q;:&q;taxonomy&q;,&q;name&q;:&q;Site - Persona&q;,&q;taxonomy_group&q;:&q;site___persona&q;,&q;value&q;:[]},&q;image&q;:{&q;type&q;:&q;asset&q;,&q;name&q;:&q;Image&q;,&q;value&q;:[{&q;name&q;:&q;Curriculum_SocialSciencesHumanitie.svg&q;,&q;description&q;:null,&q;type&q;:&q;image/svg+xml&q;,&q;size&q;:1421,&q;url&q;:&q;https://assets-us-01.kc-usercontent.com:443/fbd574c4-da36-0066-a0c5-849ffb2de96e/3b6da40a-8c33-4c8b-96c2-c1ffcbd91dbd/Curriculum_SocialSciencesHumanitie.svg&q;}]},&q;title&q;:{&q;type&q;:&q;text&q;,&q;name&q;:&q;Title&q;,&q;value&q;:&q;Social Sciences and Humanities&q;},&q;url_slug&q;:{&q;type&q;:&q;url_slug&q;,&q;name&q;:&q;Url Slug&q;,&q;value&q;:&q;social-sciences-humanities&q;},&q;content&q;:{&q;type&q;:&q;rich_text&q;,&q;name&q;:&q;Content&q;,&q;images&q;:{},&q;links&q;:{},&q;modular_content&q;:[],&q;value&q;:&q;&l;ul&g;\n  &l;li&g;This curriculum was issued in 2013.&l;/li&g;\n&l;/ul&g;&q;},&q;note&q;:{&q;type&q;:&q;text&q;,&q;name&q;:&q;Note&q;,&q;value&q;:&q;&q;},&q;sections&q;:{&q;type&q;:&q;modular_content&q;,&q;name&q;:&q;Sections&q;,&q;value&q;:[&q;res___course_description_and_prerequisite___interd_b9e15e7&q;,&q;res___course_description_and_prerequisite___scienc&q;,&q;res___course_description_and_prerequisite___scienc_262a796&q;]},&q;ui_types&q;:{&q;type&q;:&q;taxonomy&q;,&q;name&q;:&q;UI Types&q;,&q;taxonomy_group&q;:&q;ui_types&q;,&q;value&q;:[]},&q;abstract&q;:{&q;type&q;:&q;text&q;,&q;name&q;:&q;Abstract&q;,&q;value&q;:&q;&q;},&q;search_terms&q;:{&q;type&q;:&q;text&q;,&q;name&q;:&q;Search Terms&q;,&q;value&q;:&q;&q;},&q;ui___seo_meta_tags__description&q;:{&q;type&q;:&q;text&q;,&q;name&q;:&q;description&q;,&q;value&q;:&q;&q;},&q;ui___seo_meta_tags__keywords&q;:{&q;type&q;:&q;text&q;,&q;name&q;:&q;keywords&q;,&q;value&q;:&q;&q;},&q;ui___seo_meta_tags__robots&q;:{&q;type&q;:&q;text&q;,&q;name&q;:&q;robots&q;,&q;value&q;:&q;&q;},&q;ui___seo_meta_tags__og_title&q;:{&q;type&q;:&q;text&q;,&q;name&q;:&q;og:title&q;,&q;value&q;:&q;&q;},&q;ui___seo_meta_tags__og_description&q;:{&q;type&q;:&q;text&q;,&q;name&q;:&q;og:description&q;,&q;value&q;:&q;&q;}}},&q;res___course_description_prerequisite___social_sci&q;:{&q;system&q;:{&q;id&q;:&q;43c36179-4226-4d13-a869-e1deac2e5599&q;,&q;name&q;:&q;RES - Course description Prerequisite - Tech Ed&q;,&q;codename&q;:&q;res___course_description_prerequisite___social_sci&q;,&q;language&q;:&q;en-CA&q;,&q;type&q;:&q;ui___content_collection&q;,&q;collection&q;:&q;resources&q;,&q;sitemap_locations&q;:[],&q;last_modified&q;:&q;2024-08-23T17:55:10.1978287Z&q;,&q;workflow&q;:&q;default&q;,&q;workflow_step&q;:&q;published&q;},&q;elements&q;:{&q;site___persona&q;:{&q;type&q;:&q;taxonomy&q;,&q;name&q;:&q;Site - Persona&q;,&q;taxonomy_group&q;:&q;site___persona&q;,&q;value&q;:[]},&q;image&q;:{&q;type&q;:&q;asset&q;,&q;name&q;:&q;Image&q;,&q;value&q;:[{&q;name&q;:&q;Curriculum-tech.svg&q;,&q;description&q;:null,&q;type&q;:&q;image/svg+xml&q;,&q;size&q;:2743,&q;url&q;:&q;https://assets-us-01.kc-usercontent.com:443/fbd574c4-da36-0066-a0c5-849ffb2de96e/735bd9be-c11c-4dfb-9f82-df552d794513/Curriculum-tech.svg&q;}]},&q;title&q;:{&q;type&q;:&q;text&q;,&q;name&q;:&q;Title&q;,&q;value&q;:&q;Technological Education&q;},&q;url_slug&q;:{&q;type&q;:&q;url_slug&q;,&q;name&q;:&q;Url Slug&q;,&q;value&q;:&q;tech-ed&q;},&q;content&q;:{&q;type&q;:&q;rich_text&q;,&q;name&q;:&q;Content&q;,&q;images&q;:{},&q;links&q;:{},&q;modular_content&q;:[],&q;value&q;:&q;&l;ul&g;\n  &l;li&g;In May 2024, the ministry issued a new Grade 9 and 10 technological education curriculum. This curriculum includes two new courses: Technology and the Skilled Trades, Grade 9, Open (TAS1O) and Technology and the Skilled Trades, Grade 10, Open (TAS2O)&l;em&g;.&l;/em&g;&l;/li&g;\n  &l;li&g;The expectations in the new TAS1O and TAS2O courses can be used as the basis for the delivery of broad-based technology (BBT) focus courses in Grades 9 and 10. (See the complete list of courses under the &l;a href=\&q;/en/course-descriptions-and-prerequisites/tech-ed#course-descriptions\&q;&g;course descriptions for TAS1O and TAS2O.&l;/a&g;)&l;/li&g;\n  &l;li&g;As announced in March 2023, starting with the cohort of students entering Grade 9 in the 2024–25 school year, all students will be required to earn a Grade 9 or Grade 10 technological education credit as part of their Ontario Secondary School Diploma (OSSD). All Grade 9 and 10 technological education courses in the new 2024 technological education curriculum will satisfy the new graduation requirement.&a;nbsp;&l;/li&g;\n  &l;li&g;These are Grade 9 and 10 full-credit courses. They will fulfil the compulsory&a;nbsp;STEM-related course group requirement for the Ontario Secondary School Diploma.&l;/li&g;\n  &l;li&g;As of September 2024, Exploring Technologies, Grade 9 (TIJ1O) should not be offered, and the associated course code expired at the end of the 2023–24 school year. The new TAS1O and TAS2O courses replace &l;em&g;The Ontario Curriculum: Grades 9 and 10, Technological Education, 2009&l;/em&g;.&l;/li&g;\n&l;/ul&g;&q;},&q;note&q;:{&q;type&q;:&q;text&q;,&q;name&q;:&q;Note&q;,&q;value&q;:&q;&q;},&q;sections&q;:{&q;type&q;:&q;modular_content&q;,&q;name&q;:&q;Sections&q;,&q;value&q;:[&q;res___course_description_and_prerequisite___ssh___&q;,&q;res___course_description_and_prerequisite___ssh____69439ba&q;,&q;res___course_description_and_prerequisite___ssh____ab6cbdc&q;,&q;res___course_description_and_prerequisite___append_e5e45dd&q;]},&q;ui_types&q;:{&q;type&q;:&q;taxonomy&q;,&q;name&q;:&q;UI Types&q;,&q;taxonomy_group&q;:&q;ui_types&q;,&q;value&q;:[]},&q;abstract&q;:{&q;type&q;:&q;text&q;,&q;name&q;:&q;Abstract&q;,&q;value&q;:&q;&q;},&q;search_terms&q;:{&q;type&q;:&q;text&q;,&q;name&q;:&q;Search Terms&q;,&q;value&q;:&q;&q;},&q;ui___seo_meta_tags__description&q;:{&q;type&q;:&q;text&q;,&q;name&q;:&q;description&q;,&q;value&q;:&q;&q;},&q;ui___seo_meta_tags__keywords&q;:{&q;type&q;:&q;text&q;,&q;name&q;:&q;keywords&q;,&q;value&q;:&q;&q;},&q;ui___seo_meta_tags__robots&q;:{&q;type&q;:&q;text&q;,&q;name&q;:&q;robots&q;,&q;value&q;:&q;&q;},&q;ui___seo_meta_tags__og_title&q;:{&q;type&q;:&q;text&q;,&q;name&q;:&q;og:title&q;,&q;value&q;:&q;&q;},&q;ui___seo_meta_tags__og_description&q;:{&q;type&q;:&q;text&q;,&q;name&q;:&q;og:description&q;,&q;value&q;:&q;