na&q;,&q;value&q;:[]},&q;image&q;:{&q;type&q;:&q;asset&q;,&q;name&q;:&q;Image&q;,&q;value&q;:[{&q;name&q;:&q;icon-skill-collaboration.svg&q;,&q;description&q;:null,&q;type&q;:&q;image/svg+xml&q;,&q;size&q;:9945,&q;url&q;:&q;https://assets-us-01.kc-usercontent.com:443/fbd574c4-da36-0066-a0c5-849ffb2de96e/30f4aa16-1de5-4f8e-ab62-c8c8a8601398/icon-skill-collaboration.svg&q;}]},&q;title&q;:{&q;type&q;:&q;text&q;,&q;name&q;:&q;Title&q;,&q;value&q;:&q;Collaboration&q;},&q;url_slug&q;:{&q;type&q;:&q;url_slug&q;,&q;name&q;:&q;URL slug&q;,&q;value&q;:&q;collaboration&q;},&q;content&q;:{&q;type&q;:&q;rich_text&q;,&q;name&q;:&q;Content&q;,&q;images&q;:{},&q;links&q;:{},&q;modular_content&q;:[&q;ts___collabo___video_shell&q;],&q;value&q;:&q;&l;object type=\&q;application/kenticocloud\&q; data-type=\&q;item\&q; data-rel=\&q;link\&q; data-codename=\&q;ts___collabo___video_shell\&q;&g;&l;/object&g;\n&l;p&g;&l;strong&g;Definition&l;/strong&g;&l;/p&g;\n&l;p&g;Collaboration involves the interplay of the cognitive (thinking and reasoning), interpersonal, and intrapersonal competencies needed to work with others effectively and ethically. These skills deepen as they are applied, with increasing versatility, to co-construct knowledge, meaning, and content with others in diverse situations, both physical and virtual, that involve a variety of roles, groups, and perspectives.&l;/p&g;\n&l;p&g;&l;br&g;&l;/p&g;\n&l;p&g;&l;strong&g;Student Descriptors&l;/strong&g;&l;/p&g;\n&l;ul&g;\n  &l;li&g;Students participate successfully in teams by building positive and respectful relationships, developing trust, and acting cooperatively and with integrity.&l;/li&g;\n  &l;li&g;Students learn from others and contribute to their learning as they co-construct knowledge, meaning, and content.&l;/li&g;\n  &l;li&g;Students assume various roles on the team, respect a diversity of perspectives, and recognize different sources of knowledge, including Indigenous ways of knowing.&l;/li&g;\n  &l;li&g;Students address disagreements and manage conflict in a sensitive and constructive manner.&l;/li&g;\n  &l;li&g;Students interact with a variety of communities and/or groups and use various technologies appropriately to facilitate working with others.&l;/li&g;\n&l;/ul&g;&q;},&q;abstract&q;:{&q;type&q;:&q;text&q;,&q;name&q;:&q;Abstract&q;,&q;value&q;:&q;The ability to work in teams effectively by building knowledge together in physical and virtual environments.&q;},&q;credit&q;:{&q;type&q;:&q;rich_text&q;,&q;name&q;:&q;Credit&q;,&q;images&q;:{},&q;links&q;:{},&q;modular_content&q;:[],&q;value&q;:&q;&l;p&g;&l;br&g;&l;/p&g;&q;},&q;parent&q;:{&q;type&q;:&q;modular_content&q;,&q;name&q;:&q;Parent&q;,&q;value&q;:[&q;program_planning___transferable_skills&q;]},&q;ui_types&q;:{&q;type&q;:&q;taxonomy&q;,&q;name&q;:&q;UI Types&q;,&q;taxonomy_group&q;:&q;ui_types&q;,&q;value&q;:[]},&q;alert_type&q;:{&q;type&q;:&q;multiple_choice&q;,&q;name&q;:&q;Alert type&q;,&q;value&q;:[]},&q;dismissible&q;:{&q;type&q;:&q;multiple_choice&q;,&q;name&q;:&q;Dismissible&q;,&q;value&q;:[]},&q;search_terms&q;:{&q;type&q;:&q;text&q;,&q;name&q;:&q;Search Terms&q;,&q;value&q;:&q;&q;},&q;site___transferable_skills&q;:{&q;type&q;:&q;taxonomy&q;,&q;name&q;:&q;Site - Transferable Skills&q;,&q;taxonomy_group&q;:&q;site___transferable_skills&q;,&q;value&q;:[{&q;name&q;:&q;Collaboration&q;,&q;codename&q;:&q;collaboration&q;}]},&q;container_type&q;:{&q;type&q;:&q;multiple_choice&q;,&q;name&q;:&q;Container type&q;,&q;value&q;:[]},&q;callout_colour_override&q;:{&q;type&q;:&q;multiple_choice&q;,&q;name&q;:&q;Callout background colour override&q;,&q;value&q;:[]}}},&q;ts___communication&q;:{&q;system&q;:{&q;id&q;:&q;42df2c58-7165-4f09-a65b-7272ed1b1536&q;,&q;name&q;:&q;TS - Communication&q;,&q;codename&q;:&q;ts___communication&q;,&q;language&q;:&q;en-CA&q;,&q;type&q;:&q;ui___generic_content&q;,&q;collection&q;:&q;default&q;,&q;sitemap_locations&q;:[],&q;last_modified&q;:&q;2022-01-14T19:43:08.2431679Z&q;,&q;workflow&q;:&q;default&q;,&q;workflow_step&q;:&q;published&q;},&q;elements&q;:{&q;site___persona&q;:{&q;type&q;:&q;taxonomy&q;,&q;name&q;:&q;Site - Persona&q;,&q;taxonomy_group&q;:&q;site___persona&q;,&q;value&q;:[]},&q;image&q;:{&q;type&q;:&q;asset&q;,&q;name&q;:&q;Image&q;,&q;value&q;:[{&q;name&q;:&q;icon-skill-communication.svg&q;,&q;description&q;:null,&q;type&q;:&q;image/svg+xml&q;,&q;size&q;:3700,&q;url&q;:&q;https://assets-us-01.kc-usercontent.com:443/fbd574c4-da36-0066-a0c5-849ffb2de96e/829cda5b-c6e7-42ec-b10f-8baab9e29be1/icon-skill-communication.svg&q;}]},&q;title&q;:{&q;type&q;:&q;text&q;,&q;name&q;:&q;Title&q;,&q;value&q;:&q;Communication&q;},&q;url_slug&q;:{&q;type&q;:&q;url_slug&q;,&q;name&q;:&q;URL slug&q;,&q;value&q;:&q;communication&q;},&q;content&q;:{&q;type&q;:&q;rich_text&q;,&q;name&q;:&q;Content&q;,&q;images&q;:{},&q;links&q;:{},&q;modular_content&q;:[&q;ts___comm___video_shell&q;],&q;value&q;:&q;&l;object type=\&q;application/kenticocloud\&q; data-type=\&q;item\&q; data-rel=\&q;link\&q; data-codename=\&q;ts___comm___video_shell\&q;&g;&l;/object&g;\n&l;p&g;&l;strong&g;Definition&l;/strong&g;&l;/p&g;\n&l;p&g;Communication involves receiving and expressing meaning (e.g., through reading and writing, viewing and creating, listening and speaking) in different contexts and with different audiences and purposes. Effective communication increasingly involves understanding local and global perspectives and societal and cultural contexts, and using a variety of media appropriately, responsibly, safely, and with a view to creating a positive digital footprint.&l;/p&g;\n&l;p&g;&l;br&g;&l;/p&g;\n&l;p&g;&l;strong&g;Student Descriptors&l;/strong&g;&l;/p&g;\n&l;ul&g;\n  &l;li&g;Students communicate effectively in different contexts, orally and in writing, using a variety of media.&l;/li&g;\n  &l;li&g;Students communicate using the appropriate digital tools, taking care to create a positive digital footprint.&l;/li&g;\n  &l;li&g;Students ask effective questions to acquire knowledge; listen to all points of view and ensure that those views are heard; voice their own opinions; and advocate for ideas.&l;/li&g;\n  &l;li&g;Students learn about a variety of languages, including Indigenous languages, and understand the cultural importance of language.&l;/li&g;\n&l;/ul&g;&q;},&q;abstract&q;:{&q;type&q;:&q;text&q;,&q;name&q;:&q;Abstract&q;,&q;value&q;:&q;The ability to express meaning in multiple ways, in a variety of contexts, including virtual spaces, and with different audiences. &q;},&q;credit&q;:{&q;type&q;:&q;rich_text&q;,&q;name&q;:&q;Credit&q;,&q;images&q;:{},&q;links&q;:{},&q;modular_content&q;:[],&q;value&q;:&q;&l;p&g;&l;br&g;&l;/p&g;&q;},&q;parent&q;:{&q;type&q;:&q;modular_content&q;,&q;name&q;:&q;Parent&q;,&q;value&q;:[&q;program_planning___transferable_skills&q;]},&q;ui_types&q;:{&q;type&q;:&q;taxonomy&q;,&q;name&q;:&q;UI Types&q;,&q;taxonomy_group&q;:&q;ui_types&q;,&q;value&q;:[]},&q;alert_type&q;:{&q;type&q;:&q;multiple_choice&q;,&q;name&q;:&q;Alert type&q;,&q;value&q;:[]},&q;dismissible&q;:{&q;type&q;:&q;multiple_choice&q;,&q;name&q;:&q;Dismissible&q;,&q;value&q;:[]},&q;search_terms&q;:{&q;type&q;:&q;text&q;,&q;name&q;:&q;Search Terms&q;,&q;value&q;:&q;&q;},&q;site___transferable_skills&q;:{&q;type&q;:&q;taxonomy&q;,&q;name&q;:&q;Site - Transferable Skills&q;,&q;taxonomy_group&q;:&q;site___transferable_skills&q;,&q;value&q;:[{&q;name&q;:&q;Communication&q;,&q;codename&q;:&q;communication&q;}]},&q;container_type&q;:{&q;type&q;:&q;multiple_choice&q;,&q;name&q;:&q;Container type&q;,&q;value&q;:[]},&q;callout_colour_override&q;:{&q;type&q;:&q;multiple_choice&q;,&q;name&q;:&q;Callout background colour override&q;,&q;value&q;:[]}}},&q;ts___critical_thinking_and_problem_solving&q;:{&q;system&q;:{&q;id&q;:&q;1220bc6b-88eb-4a7a-bee0-29075e8d9886&q;,&q;name&q;:&q;TS - Critical Thinking and Problem Solving&q;,&q;codename&q;:&q;ts___critical_thinking_and_problem_solving&q;,&q;language&q;:&q;en-CA&q;,&q;type&q;:&q;ui___generic_content&q;,&q;collection&q;:&q;default&q;,&q;sitemap_locations&q;:[],&q;last_modified&q;:&q;2022-01-17T14:30:59.1640573Z&q;,&q;workflow&q;:&q;default&q;,&q;workflow_step&q;:&q;published&q;},&q;elements&q;:{&q;site___persona&q;:{&q;type&q;:&q;taxonomy&q;,&q;name&q;:&q;Site - Persona&q;,&q;taxonomy_group&q;:&q;site___persona&q;,&q;value&q;:[]},&q;image&q;:{&q;type&q;:&q;asset&q;,&q;name&q;:&q;Image&q;,&q;value&q;:[{&q;name&q;:&q;icon-skills-critical-thinking.svg&q;,&q;description&q;:null,&q;type&q;:&q;image/svg+xml&q;,&q;size&q;:4057,&q;url&q;:&q;https://assets-us-01.kc-usercontent.com:443/fbd574c4-da36-0066-a0c5-849ffb2de96e/c7b4bf28-a90f-4173-9fc2-2f5d84acf5f4/icon-skills-critical-thinking.svg&q;}]},&q;title&q;:{&q;type&q;:&q;text&q;,&q;name&q;:&q;Title&q;,&q;value&q;:&q;Critical Thinking and Problem Solving&q;},&q;url_slug&q;:{&q;type&q;:&q;url_slug&q;,&q;name&q;:&q;URL slug&q;,&q;value&q;:&q;critical-thinking-and-problem-solving&q;},&q;content&q;:{&q;type&q;:&q;rich_text&q;,&q;name&q;:&q;Content&q;,&q;images&q;:{},&q;links&q;:{},&q;modular_content&q;:[&q;ts___ctps___video_shell&q;],&q;value&q;:&q;&l;object type=\&q;application/kenticocloud\&q; data-type=\&q;item\&q; data-rel=\&q;link\&q; data-codename=\&q;ts___ctps___video_shell\&q;&g;&l;/object&g;\n&l;p&g;&l;strong&g;Definition&l;/strong&g;&l;/p&g;\n&l;p&g;Critical thinking and problem solving involve locating, processing, analysing, and interpreting relevant and reliable information to address complex issues and problems, make informed judgements and decisions, and take effective action. With critical thinking skills comes an awareness that solving problems can have a positive impact in the world, and this contributes to achieving one’s potential as a constructive and reflective citizen. Learning is deepened when it occurs in the context of authentic and meaningful real-world experiences.&l;/p&g;\n&l;p&g;&l;br&g;&l;/p&g;\n&l;p&g;&l;strong&g;Student Descriptors&l;/strong&g;&l;/p&g;\n&l;ul&g;\n  &l;li&g;Students engage in inquiry processes that include locating, processing, interpreting, synthesizing, and critically analysing information in order to solve problems and make informed decisions. These processes involve critical, digital, and data literacy.&l;/li&g;\n  &l;li&g;Students solve meaningful and complex real-life problems by taking concrete steps – identifying and analysing the problem, creating a plan, prioritizing actions to be taken, and acting on the plan – as they address issues and design and manage projects.&l;/li&g;\n  &l;li&g;Students detect patterns, make connections, and transfer or apply what they have learned in a given situation to other situations, including real-world situations.&l;/li&g;\n  &l;li&g;Students construct knowledge and apply what they learn to all areas of their lives – at school, home, and work; among friends; and in the community – with a focus on making connections and understanding relationships.&l;/li&g;\n  &l;li&g;Students analyse social, economic, and ecological systems to understand how they function and how they interrelate.&l;/li&g;\n&l;/ul&g;\n&l;p&g;&l;br&g;&l;/p&g;&q;},&q;abstract&q;:{&q;type&q;:&q;text&q;,&q;name&q;:&q;Abstract&q;,&q;value&q;:&q;The ability to address complex, real-world problems by acquiring and analysing information in order to take informed action.&q;},&q;credit&q;:{&q;type&q;:&q;rich_text&q;,&q;name&q;:&q;Credit&q;,&q;images&q;:{},&q;links&q;:{},&q;modular_content&q;:[],&q;value&q;:&q;&l;p&g;&l;br&g;&l;/p&g;&q;},&q;parent&q;:{&q;type&q;:&q;modular_content&q;,&q;name&q;:&q;Parent&q;,&q;value&q;:[&q;program_planning___transferable_skills&q;]},&q;ui_types&q;:{&q;type&q;:&q;taxonomy&q;,&q;name&q;:&q;UI Types&q;,&q;taxonomy_group&q;:&q;ui_types&q;,&q;value&q;:[]},&q;alert_type&q;:{&q;type&q;:&q;multiple_choice&q;,&q;name&q;:&q;Alert type&q;,&q;value&q;:[]},&q;dismissible&q;:{&q;type&q;:&q;multiple_choice&q;,&q;name&q;:&q;Dismissible&q;,&q;value&q;:[]},&q;search_terms&q;:{&q;type&q;:&q;text&q;,&q;name&q;:&q;Search Terms&q;,&q;value&q;:&q;&q;},&q;site___transferable_skills&q;:{&q;type&q;:&q;taxonomy&q;,&q;name&q;:&q;Site - Transferable Skills&q;,&q;taxonomy_group&q;:&q;site___transferable_skills&q;,&q;value&q;:[{&q;name&q;:&q;Critical Thinking &a; Problem Solving&q;,&q;codename&q;:&q;critical_thinking___problem_solving&q;}]},&q;container_type&q;:{&q;type&q;:&q;multiple_choice&q;,&q;name&q;:&q;Container type&q;,&q;value&q;:[]},&q;callout_colour_override&q;:{&q;type&q;:&q;multiple_choice&q;,&q;name&q;:&q;Callout background colour override&q;,&q;value&q;:[]}}},&q;ts___global_competence&q;:{&q;system&q;:{&q;id&q;:&q;1d67dbdb-11c5-4cdc-a415-d6d9d7e40b5a&q;,&q;name&q;:&q;TS - Global Citizenship and Sustainability&q;,&q;codename&q;:&q;ts___global_competence&q;,&q;language&q;:&q;en-CA&q;,&q;type&q;:&q;ui___generic_content&q;,&q;collection&q;:&q;default&q;,&q;sitemap_locations&q;:[],&q;last_modified&q;:&q;2022-01-14T19:44:46.7383769Z&q;,&q;workflow&q;:&q;default&q;,&q;workflow_step&q;:&q;published&q;},&q;elements&q;:{&q;site___persona&q;:{&q;type&q;:&q;taxonomy&q;,&q;name&q;:&q;Site - Persona&q;,&q;taxonomy_group&q;:&q;site___persona&q;,&q;value&q;:[]},&q;image&q;:{&q;type&q;:&q;asset&q;,&q;name&q;:&q;Image&q;,&q;value&q;:[{&q;name&q;:&q;icon-skill-global.svg&q;,&q;description&q;:null,&q;type&q;:&q;image/svg+xml&q;,&q;size&q;:5296,&q;url&q;:&q;https://assets-us-01.kc-usercontent.com:443/fbd574c4-da36-0066-a0c5-849ffb2de96e/368c87ae-9ea9-4692-94ce-2cd056eafe77/icon-skill-global.svg&q;}]},&q;title&q;:{&q;type&q;:&q;text&q;,&q;name&q;:&q;Title&q;,&q;value&q;:&q;Global Citizenship and Sustainability&q;},&q;url_slug&q;:{&q;type&q;:&q;url_slug&q;,&q;name&q;:&q;URL slug&q;,&q;value&q;:&q;global-citizenship-and-sustainability&q;},&q;content&q;:{&q;type&q;:&q;rich_text&q;,&q;name&q;:&q;Content&q;,&q;images&q;:{},&q;links&q;:{},&q;modular_content&q;:[&q;ts___gce___video_shell&q;],&q;value&q;:&q;&l;object type=\&q;application/kenticocloud\&q; data-type=\&q;item\&q; data-rel=\&q;link\&q; data-codename=\&q;ts___gce___video_shell\&q;&g;&l;/object&g;\n&l;p&g;&l;strong&g;Definition&l;/strong&g;&l;/p&g;\n&l;p&g;Global citizenship and sustainability involves understanding diverse world views and perspectives in order to effectively address the various political, environmental, social, and economic issues that are central to living sustainably in today’s interconnected and interdependent world. It also involves acquiring the knowledge, motivation, dispositions, and skills required for engaged citizenship, along with an appreciation of the diversity of people and perspectives in the world. It calls for the ability to envision and work towards a better and more sustainable future for all.&l;/p&g;\n&l;p&g;&l;br&g;&l;/p&g;\n&l;p&g;&l;strong&g;Student Descriptors&l;/strong&g;&l;/p&g;\n&l;ul&g;\n  &l;li&g;Students understand the political, environmental, economic, and social forces at play in the world today, how they interconnect, and how they affect individuals, communities, and countries.&l;/li&g;\n  &l;li&g;Students make responsible decisions and take actions that support quality of life for all, now and in the future.&l;/li&g;\n  &l;li&g;Students recognize discrimination and promote principles of equity, human rights, and democratic participation.&l;/li&g;\n  &l;li&g;Students recognize the traditions, knowledge, and histories of Indigenous peoples, appreciate their historical and contemporary contributions to Canada, and recognize the legacy of residential schools.&l;/li&g;\n  &l;li&g;Students learn from and with people of diverse cultures and backgrounds and develop cross-cultural understanding.&l;/li&g;\n  &l;li&g;Students engage in local, national, and global initiatives to make a positive difference in the world.&l;/li&g;\n  &l;li&g;Students contribute to society and to the culture of local, national, and global communities, both physical and virtual, in a responsible, inclusive, sustainable, ethical, and accountable manner.&l;/li&g;\n  &l;li&g;Students, as citizens, participate in various groups and online networks in a safe and socially responsible manner.&l;/li&g;\n&l;/ul&g;&q;},&q;abstract&q;:{&q;type&q;:&q;text&q;,&q;name&q;:&q;Abstract&q;,&q;value&q;:&q;The ability to understand local and global perspectives and appreciate the diversity of people in order to address political, environmental, social, and economic issues through an ethos of engaged citizenship.&q;},&q;credit&q;:{&q;type&q;:&q;rich_text&q;,&q;name&q;:&q;Credit&q;,&q;images&q;:{},&q;links&q;:{},&q;modular_content&q;:[],&q;value&q;:&q;&l;p&g;&l;br&g;&l;/p&g;&q;},&q;parent&q;:{&q;type&q;:&q;modular_content&q;,&q;name&q;:&q;Parent&q;,&q;value&q;:[&q;program_planning___transferable_skills&q;]},&q;ui_types&q;:{&q;type&q;:&q;taxonomy&q;,&q;name&q;:&q;UI Types&q;,&q;taxonomy_group&q;:&q;ui_types&q;,&q;value&q;:[]},&q;alert_type&q;:{&q;type&q;:&q;multiple_choice&q;,&q;name&q;:&q;Alert type&q;,&q;value&q;:[]},&q;dismissible&q;:{&q;type&q;:&q;multiple_choice&q;,&q;name&q;:&q;Dismissible&q;,&q;value&q;:[]},&q;search_terms&q;:{&q;type&q;:&q;text&q;,&q;name&q;:&q;Search Terms&q;,&q;value&q;:&q;&q;},&q;site___transferable_skills&q;:{&q;type&q;:&q;taxonomy&q;,&q;name&q;:&q;Site - Transferable Skills&q;,&q;taxonomy_group&q;:&q;site___transferable_skills&q;,&q;value&q;:[{&q;name&q;:&q;Global Citizenship and Sustainability&q;,&q;codename&q;:&q;global_competence&q;}]},&q;container_type&q;:{&q;type&q;:&q;multiple_choice&q;,&q;name&q;:&q;Container type&q;,&q;value&q;:[]},&q;callout_colour_override&q;:{&q;type&q;:&q;multiple_choice&q;,&q;name&q;:&q;Callout background colour override&q;,&q;value&q;:[]}}},&q;ts___innovation__creativity&q;:{&q;system&q;:{&q;id&q;:&q;9eb9a5e2-e607-4085-9609-6627e9da1bad&q;,&q;name&q;:&q;TS - Innovation, Creativity&q;,&q;codename&q;:&q;ts___innovation__creativity&q;,&q;language&q;:&q;en-CA&q;,&q;type&q;:&q;ui___generic_content&q;,&q;collection&q;:&q;default&q;,&q;sitemap_locations&q;:[],&q;last_modified&q;:&q;2022-01-14T19:37:20.7781278Z&q;,&q;workflow&q;:&q;default&q;,&q;workflow_step&q;:&q;published&q;},&q;elements&q;:{&q;site___persona&q;:{&q;type&q;:&q;taxonomy&q;,&q;name&q;:&q;Site - Persona&q;,&q;taxonomy_group&q;:&q;site___persona&q;,&q;value&q;:[]},&q;image&q;:{&q;type&q;:&q;asset&q;,&q;name&q;:&q;Image&q;,&q;value&q;:[{&q;name&q;:&q;icons-skill-innovation.svg&q;,&q;description&q;:null,&q;type&q;:&q;image/svg+xml&q;,&q;size&q;:2304,&q;url&q;:&q;https://assets-us-01.kc-usercontent.com:443/fbd574c4-da36-0066-a0c5-849ffb2de96e/7092f285-fa51-4138-8360-e4f9f495cbe5/icons-skill-innovation.svg&q;}]},&q;title&q;:{&q;type&q;:&q;text&q;,&q;name&q;:&q;Title&q;,&q;value&q;:&q;Innovation, Creativity, and Entrepreneurship &q;},&q;url_slug&q;:{&q;type&q;:&q;url_slug&q;,&q;name&q;:&q;URL slug&q;,&q;value&q;:&q;innovation-creativity-and-entrepreneurship&q;},&q;content&q;:{&q;type&q;:&q;rich_text&q;,&q;name&q;:&q;Content&q;,&q;images&q;:{},&q;links&q;:{},&q;modular_content&q;:[&q;ts___ice___video_shell&q;],&q;value&q;:&q;&l;object type=\&q;application/kenticocloud\&q; data-type=\&q;item\&q; data-rel=\&q;link\&q; data-codename=\&q;ts___ice___video_shell\&q;&g;&l;/object&g;\n&l;p&g;&l;strong&g;Definition&l;/strong&g;&l;/p&g;\n&l;p&g;Innovation, creativity, and entrepreneurship support the ability to turn ideas into action in order to meet the needs of a community. These skills include the capacity to develop concepts, ideas, or products for the purpose of contributing innovative solutions to economic, social, and environmental problems. Developing these skills involves a willingness to assume leadership roles, take risks, and engage in independent, unconventional thinking in the context of experimenting, conducting research, and exploring new strategies, techniques, and perspectives. An entrepreneurial mindset understands the importance of building and scaling ideas for sustainable growth.&l;/p&g;\n&l;p&g;&l;br&g;&l;/p&g;\n&l;p&g;&l;strong&g;Student Descriptors&l;/strong&g;&l;/p&g;\n&l;ul&g;\n  &l;li&g;Students formulate and express insightful questions and opinions to generate novel ideas.&l;/li&g;\n  &l;li&g;Students contribute solutions to economic, social, and environmental problems in order to meet a need in a community by: enhancing concepts, ideas, or products through a creative process; taking risks in their creative thinking as they devise solutions; making discoveries through inquiry research, by testing hypotheses and experimenting with new strategies or techniques.&l;/li&g;\n  &l;li&g;Students demonstrate leadership, initiative, imagination, creativity, spontaneity, and ingenuity as they engage in a range of creative processes, motivating others with their ethical entrepreneurial spirit.&l;/li&g;\n&l;/ul&g;&q;},&q;abstract&q;:{&q;type&q;:&q;text&q;,&q;name&q;:&q;Abstract&q;,&q;value&q;:&q;The ability to explore, enhance, and scale ideas in creative ways and bring them into action to meet the needs of a community.&q;},&q;credit&q;:{&q;type&q;:&q;rich_text&q;,&q;name&q;:&q;Credit&q;,&q;images&q;:{},&q;links&q;:{},&q;modular_content&q;:[],&q;value&q;:&q;&l;p&g;&l;br&g;&l;/p&g;&q;},&q;parent&q;:{&q;type&q;:&q;modular_content&q;,&q;name&q;:&q;Parent&q;,&q;value&q;:[&q;program_planning___transferable_skills&q;]},&q;ui_types&q;:{&q;type&q;:&q;taxonomy&q;,&q;name&q;:&q;UI Types&q;,&q;taxonomy_group&q;:&q;ui_types&q;,&q;value&q;:[]},&q;alert_type&q;:{&q;type&q;:&q;multiple_choice&q;,&q;name&q;:&q;Alert type&q;,&q;value&q;:[]},&q;dismissible&q;:{&q;type&q;:&q;multiple_choice&q;,&q;name&q;:&q;Dismissible&q;,&q;value&q;:[]},&q;search_terms&q;:{&q;type&q;:&q;text&q;,&q;name&q;:&q;Search Terms&q;,&q;value&q;:&q;&q;},&q;site___transferable_skills&q;:{&q;type&q;:&q;taxonomy&q;,&q;name&q;:&q;Site - Transferable Skills&q;,&q;taxonomy_group&q;:&q;site___transferable_skills&q;,&q;value&q;:[{&q;name&q;:&q;Innovation, Creativity &a; Entrepreneurship&q;,&q;codename&q;:&q;innovation__creativity___entrepreneurship&q;}]},&q;container_type&q;:{&q;type&q;:&q;multiple_choice&q;,&q;name&q;:&q;Container type&q;,&q;value&q;:[]},&q;callout_colour_override&q;:{&q;type&q;:&q;multiple_choice&q;,&q;name&q;:&q;Callout background colour override&q;,&q;value&q;:[]}}},&q;ts___introduction&q;:{&q;system&q;:{&q;id&q;:&q;a834127c-7508-4395-a9f3-ac494e744dd7&q;,&q;name&q;:&q;TS - Introduction&q;,&q;codename&q;:&q;ts___introduction&q;,&q;language&q;:&q;en-CA&q;,&q;type&q;:&q;ui___generic_content&q;,&q;collection&q;:&q;default&q;,&q;sitemap_locations&q;:[],&q;last_modified&q;:&q;2023-07-18T17:18:25.7273583Z&q;,&q;workflow&q;:&q;default&q;,&q;workflow_step&q;:&q;published&q;},&q;elements&q;:{&q;site___persona&q;:{&q;type&q;:&q;taxonomy&q;,&q;name&q;:&q;Site - Persona&q;,&q;taxonomy_group&q;:&q;site___persona&q;,&q;value&q;:[]},&q;image&q;:{&q;type&q;:&q;asset&q;,&q;name&q;:&q;Image&q;,&q;value&q;:[]},&q;title&q;:{&q;type&q;:&q;text&q;,&q;name&q;:&q;Title&q;,&q;value&q;:&q;Introduction&q;},&q;url_slug&q;:{&q;type&q;:&q;url_slug&q;,&q;name&q;:&q;URL slug&q;,&q;value&q;:&q;introduction&q;},&q;content&q;:{&q;type&q;:&q;rich_text&q;,&q;name&q;:&q;Content&q;,&q;images&q;:{},&q;links&q;:{&q;d0d3e4ec-aa12-414f-af23-7e383639b934&q;:{&q;codename&q;:&q;fn___transferable_skills_and_competencies&q;,&q;type&q;:&q;footnotes&q;,&q;url_slug&q;:&q;&q;}},&q;modular_content&q;:[&q;ts___intro___video_shell&q;],&q;value&q;:&q;&l;object type=\&q;application/kenticocloud\&q; data-type=\&q;item\&q; data-rel=\&q;link\&q; data-codename=\&q;ts___intro___video_shell\&q;&g;&l;/object&g;\n&l;h4&g;The Importance of Transferable Skills in the Curriculum&l;/h4&g;\n&l;p&g;Today’s graduates will enter a world that is more competitive, more globally connected, and more technologically engaged than it has been in any other period of history. Over the course of the next decade, millions of young Canadians will enter a workforce that is dramatically different from the one we know today. With the growing automation of jobs, extraordinary technological advancements, and the realities of a global economy, students will need to be prepared for job flexibility, frequent career re-orientation, and work and civic life in a globalized, digital age. Equipping students with transferable skills and a desire for lifelong learning will help to prepare them for these new realities, and to navigate and shape their future successfully.&l;/p&g;\n&l;p&g;Transferable skills are the skills and attributes that students need in order to thrive in the modern world. Based on international research, information provided by employers, and its work with jurisdictions across Canada, the Ontario Ministry of Education has defined seven important categories of transferable skills – sometimes referred to as &l;a data-item-id=\&q;d0d3e4ec-aa12-414f-af23-7e383639b934\&q; href=\&q;\&q;&g;“competencies”&l;/a&g; – that will help students navigate the world of work and meet with success in the future:&a;nbsp;&l;/p&g;\n&l;ul&g;\n  &l;li&g;critical thinking and problem solving&l;/li&g;\n  &l;li&g;innovation, creativity, and entrepreneurship&l;/li&g;\n  &l;li&g;self-directed learning&l;/li&g;\n  &l;li&g;collaboration&l;/li&g;\n  &l;li&g;communication&l;/li&g;\n  &l;li&g;global citizenship and sustainability&l;/li&g;\n  &l;li&g;digital literacy&l;/li&g;\n&l;/ul&g;\n&l;p&g;These seven broad categories of skills, necessary in today’s rapidly changing world, can be seen as a framework encompassing the wide range of discrete transferable skills that students acquire over time. Developing transferable skills essentially means “learning for transfer” – that is, taking what is learned in one situation and applying it to other, new situations. Students in Ontario schools “learn for transfer” in all of the subjects and disciplines of the Ontario curriculum, from Kindergarten to Grade 12. In fact, in every grade and subject, their learning is assessed, in part, in terms of their ability to apply or transfer what they have learned to familiar and new contexts (see the category “Application” in the &l;a href=\&q;https://www.dcp.edu.gov.on.ca/en/assessment-evaluation/sample-achievement-charts\&q;&g;Sample Achievement Charts&l;/a&g;). The curriculum provides opportunities for students to develop transferable skills in age- and grade-appropriate ways throughout their school years. Students develop transferable skills not in isolation but as part of their learning in all subjects of the curriculum. These skills are developed through students’ cognitive, social, emotional, and physical engagement in learning. Educators facilitate students’ development of transferable skills explicitly through a variety of teaching and learning methods, models, and approaches, and assessment practices, in a safe, inclusive, and equitable learning environment.&l;/p&g;\n&l;p&g;&l;br&g;&l;/p&g;&q;},&q;abstract&q;:{&q;type&q;:&q;text&q;,&q;name&q;:&q;Abstract&q;,&q;value&q;:&q;&q;},&q;credit&q;:{&q;type&q;:&q;rich_text&q;,&q;name&q;:&q;Credit&q;,&q;images&q;:{},&q;links&q;:{},&q;modular_content&q;:[],&q;value&q;:&q;&l;p&g;&l;br&g;&l;/p&g;&q;},&q;parent&q;:{&q;type&q;:&q;modular_content&q;,&q;name&q;:&q;Parent&q;,&q;value&q;:[]},&q;ui_types&q;:{&q;type&q;:&q;taxonomy&q;,&q;name&q;:&q;UI Types&q;,&q;taxonomy_group&q;:&q;ui_types&q;,&q;value&q;:[]},&q;alert_type&q;:{&q;type&q;:&q;multiple_choice&q;,&q;name&q;:&q;Alert type&q;,&q;value&q;:[]},&q;dismissible&q;:{&q;type&q;:&q;multiple_choice&q;,&q;name&q;:&q;Dismissible&q;,&q;value&q;:[]},&q;search_terms&q;:{&q;type&q;:&q;text&q;,&q;name&q;:&q;Search Terms&q;,&q;value&q;:&q;&q;},&q;site___transferable_skills&q;:{&q;type&q;:&q;taxonomy&q;,&q;name&q;:&q;Site - Transferable Skills&q;,&q;taxonomy_group&q;:&q;site___transferable_skills&q;,&q;value&q;:[]},&q;container_type&q;:{&q;type&q;:&q;multiple_choice&q;,&q;name&q;:&q;Container type&q;,&q;value&q;:[]},&q;callout_colour_override&q;:{&q;type&q;:&q;multiple_choice&q;,&q;name&q;:&q;Callout background colour override&q;,&q;value&q;:[]}}},&q;ts___self_directed_learning&q;:{&q;system&q;:{&q;id&q;:&q;cb6fb737-6445-40d5-9933-2d3e00f3bbb5&q;,&q;name&q;:&q;TS - Self Directed Learning&q;,&q;codename&q;:&q;ts___self_directed_learning&q;,&q;language&q;:&q;en-CA&q;,&q;type&q;:&q;ui___generic_content&q;,&q;collection&q;:&q;default&q;,&q;sitemap_locations&q;:[],&q;last_modified&q;:&q;2022-01-14T19:38:43.6232374Z&q;,&q;workflow&q;:&q;default&q;,&q;workflow_step&q;:&q;published&q;},&q;elements&q;:{&q;site___persona&q;:{&q;type&q;:&q;taxonomy&q;,&q;name&q;:&q;Site - Persona&q;,&q;taxonomy_group&q;:&q;site___persona&q;,&q;value&q;:[]},&q;image&q;:{&q;type&q;:&q;asset&q;,&q;name&q;:&q;Image&q;,&q;value&q;:[{&q;name&q;:&q;icon-skills-self-directed-learning.svg&q;,&q;description&q;:null,&q;type&q;:&q;image/svg+xml&q;,&q;size&q;:3275,&q;url&q;:&q;https://assets-us-01.kc-usercontent.com:443/fbd574c4-da36-0066-a0c5-849ffb2de96e/6f4156b5-07d7-4b44-af83-6d6b36b65e63/icon-skills-self-directed-learning.svg&q;}]},&q;title&q;:{&q;type&q;:&q;text&q;,&q;name&q;:&q;Title&q;,&q;value&q;:&q;Self-Directed Learning&q;},&q;url_slug&q;:{&q;type&q;:&q;url_slug&q;,&q;name&q;:&q;URL slug&q;,&q;value&q;:&q;self-directed-learning&q;},&q;content&q;:{&q;type&q;:&q;rich_text&q;,&q;name&q;:&q;Content&q;,&q;images&q;:{},&q;links&q;:{},&q;modular_content&q;:[&q;ts___sdl___video_shell&q;],&q;value&q;:&q;&l;object type=\&q;application/kenticocloud\&q; data-type=\&q;item\&q; data-rel=\&q;link\&q; data-codename=\&q;ts___sdl___video_shell\&q;&g;&l;/object&g;\n&l;p&g;&l;strong&g;Definition&l;/strong&g;&l;/p&g;\n&l;p&g;Self-directed learning involves becoming aware of and managing one’s own process of learning. It includes developing dispositions that support motivation, self-regulation, perseverance, adaptability, and resilience. It also calls for a growth mindset – a belief in one’s ability to learn – combined with the use of strategies for planning, reflecting on, and monitoring progress towards one’s goals, and reviewing potential next steps, strategies, and results. Self-reflection and thinking about thinking (metacognition) support lifelong learning, adaptive capacity, well-being, and the ability to transfer learning in an ever-changing world.&l;/p&g;\n&l;p&g;&l;br&g;&l;/p&g;\n&l;p&g;&l;strong&g;Student Descriptors&l;/strong&g;&l;/p&g;\n&l;ul&g;\n  &l;li&g;Students learn to think about their own thinking and learning (metacognition) and to believe in their ability to learn and grow (growth mindset). They develop their ability to set goals, stay motivated, and work independently.&l;/li&g;\n  &l;li&g;Students who regulate their own learning are better prepared to become lifelong learners. They reflect on their thinking, experiences, and values, and respond to critical feedback, to enhance their learning. They also monitor the progress of their learning.&l;/li&g;\n  &l;li&g;Students develop a sense of identity in the context of Canada’s various and diverse communities.&l;/li&g;\n  &l;li&g;Students cultivate emotional intelligence to better understand themselves and others and build healthy relationships.&l;/li&g;\n  &l;li&g;Students learn to take the past into account in order to understand the present and approach the future in a more informed way.&l;/li&g;\n  &l;li&g;Students develop personal, educational, and career goals and persevere to overcome challenges in order to reach those goals. They learn to adapt to change and become resilient in the face of adversity.&l;/li&g;\n  &l;li&g;Students become managers of the various aspects of their lives – cognitive, emotional, social, physical, and spiritual – to enhance their mental health and overall well-being.&l;/li&g;\n&l;/ul&g;&q;},&q;abstract&q;:{&q;type&q;:&q;text&q;,&q;name&q;:&q;Abstract&q;,&q;value&q;:&q;The ability to develop attitudes, strategies, and skills to support one’s motivation and confidence in order to become a lifelong learner.&q;},&q;credit&q;:{&q;type&q;:&q;rich_text&q;,&q;name&q;:&q;Credit&q;,&q;images&q;:{},&q;links&q;:{},&q;modular_content&q;:[],&q;value&q;:&q;&l;p&g;&l;br&g;&l;/p&g;&q;},&q;parent&q;:{&q;type&q;:&q;modular_content&q;,&q;name&q;:&q;Parent&q;,&q;value&q;:[&q;program_planning___transferable_skills&q;]},&q;ui_types&q;:{&q;type&q;:&q;taxonomy&q;,&q;name&q;:&q;UI Types&q;,&q;taxonomy_group&q;:&q;ui_types&q;,&q;value&q;:[]},&q;alert_type&q;:{&q;type&q;:&q;multiple_choice&q;,&q;name&q;:&q;Alert type&q;,&q;value&q;:[]},&q;dismissible&q;:{&q;type&q;:&q;multiple_choice&q;,&q;name&q;:&q;Dismissible&q;,&q;value&q;:[]},&q;search_terms&q;:{&q;type&q;:&q;text&q;,&q;name&q;:&q;Search Terms&q;,&q;value&q;:&q;&q;},&q;site___transferable_skills&q;:{&q;type&q;:&q;taxonomy&q;,&q;name&q;:&q;Site - Transferable Skills&q;,&q;taxonomy_group&q;:&q;site___transferable_skills&q;,&q;value&q;:[{&q;name&q;:&q;Self-Directed Learning&q;,&q;codename&q;:&q;self_directed_learning&q;}]},&q;container_type&q;:{&q;type&q;:&q;multiple_choice&q;,&q;name&q;:&q;Container type&q;,&q;value&q;:[]},&q;callout_colour_override&q;:{&q;type&q;:&q;multiple_choice&q;,&q;name&q;:&q;Callout background colour override&q;,&q;value&q;:[]}}},&q;ts___technological_fluency&q;:{&q;system&q;:{&q;id&q;:&q;61dc49c3-7bee-4af0-b7fb-64e1a2576a41&q;,&q;name&q;:&q;TS - Digital Literacy&q;,&q;codename&q;:&q;ts___technological_fluency&q;,&q;language&q;:&q;en-CA&q;,&q;type&q;:&q;ui___generic_content&q;,&q;collection&q;:&q;default&q;,&q;sitemap_locations&q;:[],&q;last_modified&q;:&q;2022-01-14T19:46:36.0310281Z&q;,&q;workflow&q;:&q;default&q;,&q;workflow_step&q;:&q;published&q;},&q;elements&q;:{&q;site___persona&q;:{&q;type&q;:&q;taxonomy&q;,&q;name&q;:&q;Site - Persona&q;,&q;taxonomy_group&q;:&q;site___persona&q;,&q;value&q;:[]},&q;image&q;:{&q;type&q;:&q;asset&q;,&q;name&q;:&q;Image&q;,&q;value&q;:[{&q;name&q;:&q;icon-skill-technology.svg&q;,&q;description&q;:null,&q;type&q;:&q;image/svg+xml&q;,&q;size&q;:6253,&q;url&q;:&q;https://assets-us-01.kc-usercontent.com:443/fbd574c4-da36-0066-a0c5-849ffb2de96e/05364338-b89f-488d-86cc-6203eef25b70/icon-skill-technology.svg&q;}]},&q;title&q;:{&q;type&q;:&q;text&q;,&q;name&q;:&q;Title&q;,&q;value&q;:&q;Digital Literacy&q;},&q;url_slug&q;:{&q;type&q;:&q;url_slug&q;,&q;name&q;:&q;URL slug&q;,&q;value&q;:&q;digital-literacy&q;},&q;content&q;:{&q;type&q;:&q;rich_text&q;,&q;name&q;:&q;Content&q;,&q;images&q;:{},&q;links&q;:{},&q;modular_content&q;:[&q;ts___digital_literacy___video_shell&q;],&q;value&q;:&q;&l;object type=\&q;application/kenticocloud\&q; data-type=\&q;item\&q; data-rel=\&q;link\&q; data-codename=\&q;ts___digital_literacy___video_shell\&q;&g;&l;/object&g;\n&l;p&g;&l;strong&g;Definition&l;/strong&g;&l;/p&g;\n&l;p&g;Digital literacy involves the ability to solve problems using technology in a safe, legal, and ethically responsible manner. With the ever-expanding role of digitalization and big data in the modern world, digital literacy also means having strong data literacy skills and the ability to engage with emerging technologies. Digitally literate students recognize the rights and responsibilities, as well as the opportunities, that come with living, learning, and working in an interconnected digital world.&l;/p&g;\n&l;p&g;&l;br&g;&l;/p&g;\n&l;p&g;&l;strong&g;Student Descriptors&l;/strong&g;&l;/p&g;\n&l;ul&g;\n  &l;li&g;Students select and use appropriate digital tools to collaborate, communicate, create, innovate, and solve problems.&a;nbsp;&l;/li&g;\n  &l;li&g;Students understand how to manage and regulate their use of technology to support their mental health and well-being.&l;/li&g;\n  &l;li&g;Students use digital tools to define and plan data searches, collect data, and identify relevant data sets. They analyse, interpret, and graphically represent, or “visualize”, data in various ways to solve problems and inform decisions.&a;nbsp;&l;/li&g;\n  &l;li&g;Students demonstrate a willingness and confidence to explore and use new or unfamiliar digital tools and emerging technologies (e.g., open source software, wikis, robotics, augmented reality). Students understand how different technologies are connected and recognize their benefits and limitations.&l;/li&g;\n  &l;li&g;Students manage their digital footprint by engaging in social media and online communities respectfully, inclusively, safely, legally, and ethically.&a;nbsp; Students understand their rights with respect to personal data and know how to protect their privacy and security and respect the privacy and security of others.&l;/li&g;\n  &l;li&g;Students analyse and understand the impact of technological advancements on society, and society’s role in the evolution of technology.&l;/li&g;\n&l;/ul&g;&q;},&q;abstract&q;:{&q;type&q;:&q;text&q;,&q;name&q;:&q;Abstract&q;,&q;value&q;:&q;The ability to responsibly use and apply technology to collaborate, communicate, create, innovate, and solve problems.   &q;},&q;credit&q;:{&q;type&q;:&q;rich_text&q;,&q;name&q;:&q;Credit&q;,&q;images&q;:{},&q;links&q;:{},&q;modular_content&q;:[],&q;value&q;:&q;&l;p&g;&l;br&g;&l;/p&g;&q;},&q;parent&q;:{&q;type&q;:&q;modular_content&q;,&q;name&q;:&q;Parent&q;,&q;value&q;:[&q;program_planning___transferable_skills&q;]},&q;ui_types&q;:{&q;type&q;:&q;taxonomy&q;,&q;name&q;:&q;UI Types&q;,&q;taxonomy_group&q;:&q;ui_types&q;,&q;value&q;:[]},&q;alert_type&q;:{&q;type&q;:&q;multiple_choice&q;,&q;name&q;:&q;Alert type&q;,&q;value&q;:[]},&q;dismissible&q;:{&q;type&q;:&q;multiple_choice&q;,&q;name&q;:&q;Dismissible&q;,&q;value&q;:[]},&q;search_terms&q;:{&q;type&q;:&q;text&q;,&q;name&q;:&q;Search Terms&q;,&q;value&q;:&q;&q;},&q;site___transferable_skills&q;:{&q;type&q;:&q;taxonomy&q;,&q;name&q;:&q;Site - Transferable Skills&q;,&q;taxonomy_group&q;:&q;site___transferable_skills&q;,&q;value&q;:[{&q;name&q;:&q;Digital Literacy&q;,&q;codename&q;:&q;technological_fluency&q;}]},&q;container_type&q;:{&q;type&q;:&q;multiple_choice&q;,&q;name&q;:&q;Container type&q;,&q;value&q;:[]},&q;callout_colour_override&q;:{&q;type&q;:&q;multiple_choice&q;,&q;name&q;:&q;Callout background colour override&q;,&q;value&q;:[]}}},&q;understand_your_child_s_learning_horizontal_widget&q;:{&q;system&q;:{&q;id&q;:&q;f5199fda-30cc-4b8d-99