&q;url&q;:&q;https://assets-us-01.kc-usercontent.com:443/fbd574c4-da36-0066-a0c5-849ffb2de96e/4332d281-cef5-470b-85fd-d55a83e030af/curriculum-hpe%20%281%29.svg&q;}]},&q;curriculum_pdfs&q;:{&q;type&q;:&q;modular_content&q;,&q;name&q;:&q;Curriculum PDFs&q;,&q;value&q;:[&q;hpe___elementary___curriculum_pdf&q;]},&q;intro_videos&q;:{&q;type&q;:&q;rich_text&q;,&q;name&q;:&q;Intro Videos&q;,&q;images&q;:{},&q;links&q;:{},&q;modular_content&q;:[],&q;value&q;:&q;&l;p&g;&l;br&g;&l;/p&g;&q;},&q;glossary_disclaimer&q;:{&q;type&q;:&q;rich_text&q;,&q;name&q;:&q;Glossary Disclaimer&q;,&q;images&q;:{},&q;links&q;:{},&q;modular_content&q;:[],&q;value&q;:&q;&l;p&g;The definitions provided in this glossary are specific to the curriculum context in which the terms are used.&a;nbsp;&l;br&g;\n&l;/p&g;\n&l;p&g;Many of the definitions related to sexual health are taken from two publications of the Ontario Human Rights Commission (OHRC): &l;a href=\&q;http://www.ohrc.on.ca/en/teaching-human-rights-ontario-guide-ontario-schools\&q; data-new-window=\&q;true\&q; title=\&q;Link to Teaching Human Rights in Ontario\&q; target=\&q;_blank\&q; rel=\&q;noopener noreferrer\&q;&g;&l;em&g;Teaching Human Rights in Ontario: A Guide for Ontario Schools&l;/em&g;&l;/a&g; and &l;a href=\&q;http://www.ohrc.on.ca/en/policy-preventing-discrimination-because-gender-identity-and-gender-expression\&q; data-new-window=\&q;true\&q; title=\&q;Policy on Preventing Discrimination\&q; target=\&q;_blank\&q; rel=\&q;noopener noreferrer\&q;&g;&l;em&g;Policy on Preventing Discrimination because of Gender Identity and Gender Expression&l;/em&g;.&l;/a&g;&l;/p&g;&q;},&q;downloads&q;:{&q;type&q;:&q;modular_content&q;,&q;name&q;:&q;Downloads&q;,&q;value&q;:[]},&q;monarchs_printer_year&q;:{&q;type&q;:&q;text&q;,&q;name&q;:&q;King&s;s Printer Year&q;,&q;value&q;:&q;2019&q;},&q;revision_content&q;:{&q;type&q;:&q;rich_text&q;,&q;name&q;:&q;Revision content&q;,&q;images&q;:{},&q;links&q;:{},&q;modular_content&q;:[],&q;value&q;:&q;&l;p&g;This curriculum policy replaces &l;em&g;The Ontario Curriculum, Grades 1–8: Health and Physical Education, Interim Edition&l;/em&g;, re-issued in 2018. All health and physical education programs for Grades 1–8 are now based on the expectations outlined in this curriculum policy.&l;/p&g;&q;},&q;revision_history&q;:{&q;type&q;:&q;modular_content&q;,&q;name&q;:&q;Revision history&q;,&q;value&q;:[&q;test_hpe_revision_history_item&q;]},&q;language_equivalent_curriculum_disclaimer&q;:{&q;type&q;:&q;text&q;,&q;name&q;:&q;Language equivalent curriculum disclaimer&q;,&q;value&q;:&q;&q;},&q;language_equivalent_curriculum_name&q;:{&q;type&q;:&q;rich_text&q;,&q;name&q;:&q;Language equivalent curriculum name&q;,&q;images&q;:{},&q;links&q;:{},&q;modular_content&q;:[],&q;value&q;:&q;&l;p&g;&l;em&g;Le curriculum de l’Ontario, de la 1&l;/em&g;&l;em&g;&l;sup&g;re&l;/sup&g;&l;/em&g;&l;em&g; à la 8&l;/em&g;&l;em&g;&l;sup&g;e&l;/sup&g;&l;/em&g;&l;em&g; année – Éducation physique et santé &l;/em&g;(2019)&l;/p&g;&q;}}},&q;elementary___health_and_physical_education__2019__&q;:{&q;system&q;:{&q;id&q;:&q;197d4fc8-4bf5-48ba-8252-5aadd8e1e5b4&q;,&q;name&q;:&q;Kindergarten (2026) (L1)&q;,&q;codename&q;:&q;elementary___health_and_physical_education__2019__&q;,&q;language&q;:&q;en-CA&q;,&q;type&q;:&q;l1___curriculum&q;,&q;collection&q;:&q;default&q;,&q;sitemap_locations&q;:[],&q;last_modified&q;:&q;2026-08-07T15:18:52.5920715Z&q;,&q;workflow&q;:&q;default&q;,&q;workflow_step&q;:&q;published&q;},&q;elements&q;:{&q;site___curriculum_select__elem__sec____curriculum&q;:{&q;type&q;:&q;taxonomy&q;,&q;name&q;:&q;Site - Curriculum Select (Elem, Sec) + Curriculum&q;,&q;taxonomy_group&q;:&q;site___curriculum_select__elem__sec____curriculum&q;,&q;value&q;:[{&q;name&q;:&q;Elementary&q;,&q;codename&q;:&q;elementary&q;},{&q;name&q;:&q;Kindergarten&q;,&q;codename&q;:&q;kindergarten&q;}]},&q;context&q;:{&q;type&q;:&q;modular_content&q;,&q;name&q;:&q;Context&q;,&q;value&q;:[&q;kinder_2026___curriculum_context_