specific to the curriculum context in which the terms are used.&l;/p&g;\n&l;p&g;Terms that apply throughout the document are listed under “General”. Terms that apply only to classical languages and to the Classical Civilization course are listed under “Classical Studies”.&l;/p&g;\n&l;p&g;Instructional strategies are for the most part not included in the glossary. A list of relevant strategies, with detailed explanations of each, is given in Appendix C.&l;/p&g;&q;},&q;downloads&q;:{&q;type&q;:&q;modular_content&q;,&q;name&q;:&q;Downloads&q;,&q;value&q;:[]},&q;monarchs_printer_year&q;:{&q;type&q;:&q;text&q;,&q;name&q;:&q;King&s;s Printer Year&q;,&q;value&q;:&q;2016&q;},&q;revision_content&q;:{&q;type&q;:&q;rich_text&q;,&q;name&q;:&q;Revision content&q;,&q;images&q;:{},&q;links&q;:{},&q;modular_content&q;:[],&q;value&q;:&q;&l;p&g;&l;br&g;&l;/p&g;&q;},&q;revision_history&q;:{&q;type&q;:&q;modular_content&q;,&q;name&q;:&q;Revision history&q;,&q;value&q;:[]},&q;language_equivalent_curriculum_disclaimer&q;:{&q;type&q;:&q;text&q;,&q;name&q;:&q;Language equivalent curriculum disclaimer&q;,&q;value&q;:&q;&q;},&q;language_equivalent_curriculum_name&q;:{&q;type&q;:&q;rich_text&q;,&q;name&q;:&q;Language equivalent curriculum name&q;,&q;images&q;:{},&q;links&q;:{},&q;modular_content&q;:[],&q;value&q;:&q;&l;p&g;Le curriculum de l’Ontario de la 1&l;sup&g;re&l;/sup&g; à la 8&l;sup&g;e&l;/sup&g; année –&a;nbsp;Études classiques et langues internationales (2016)&l;/p&g;&q;}}},&q;sec___cws___home_page__copy_&q;:{&q;system&q;:{&q;id&q;:&q;7cad3ec5-9d65-424d-9d59-e240c2a720e4&q;,&q;name&q;:&q;Sec - HPE - Home Page&q;,&q;codename&q;:&q;sec___cws___home_page__copy_&q;,&q;language&q;:&q;en-CA&q;,&q;type&q;:&q;ui___view&q;,&q;collection&q;:&q;default&q;,&q;sitemap_locations&q;:[],&q;last_modified&q;:&q;2022-05-16T15:05:24.713231Z&q;,&q;workflow&q;:&q;default&q;,&q;workflow_step&q;:&q;published&q;},&q;elements&q;:{&q;resource_site_link&q;:{&q;type&q;:&q;multiple_choice&q;,&q;name&q;:&q;Resour